# CodeAlpha Social Media Platform

A social media web application developed as part of the CodeAlpha Full Stack Development Internship.

## Features
- Create posts
- Like posts
- Comment on posts
- Follow/Unfollow functionality
- Responsive user interface

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates the core functionality of a social media platform by allowing users to create and interact with posts. Users can like content, leave comments, and follow profiles through a simple and user-friendly interface.

